          <Pad Id="DNhBWfDa6jcPRsMJ6rWztl" Bounds="60,90,520,82" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="A map with no tiles is a blank window, and blank has no direction. The graticule is the coordinate system itself, drawn: meridians and parallels at a spacing that follows the zoom. No network anywhere in this patch.">
